# 🚀 AI-Powered Student Performance Prediction System

> Version: **v1.0.0** | Capstone Project – AB Talks 60-Day Claude AI Challenge

## 📖 Overview

The AI-Powered Student Performance Prediction System is a machine learning web application that predicts student academic performance using historical educational and demographic data. The application helps educators identify at-risk students early and provides actionable insights for improving learning outcomes.

This project was built as the final capstone of the **AB Talks 60-Day Claude AI Challenge**, following the complete Software Development Lifecycle—from planning and system design to development, testing, deployment, and production release.

